<title>USA: Material Sciences names Thomas Moore COO.</title>
<headline>Material Sciences names Thomas Moore COO.</headline>
<dateline>ELK GROVE VILLAGE, Ill. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Material Sciences Corp said it named Thomas Moore chief operating officer and executive vice president.</p>
<p>He was formerly a unit general manager and executive vice president with the materials manufacturer.</p>
<p>He replaces Gerald Nadig, who was promoted to chief executive officer effective January 1, the company said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
